\section{Secondary Reflection Enhancement}
\label{SEC:Secondary Relection Enhancement}
To address the challenge of obstructed LoS paths in real-world scenarios, we utilize secondary reflections, multipath signals that retain the hand's motion and phase characteristics, to assist the primary signal in reconstructing a complete and reliable tremor signal in this section.
